  "tribal_context": "Arizona has 22 federally recognized tribes \u2014 the third most of any state. The Inter Tribal Council of Arizona (ITCA) represents 21 tribes. The Navajo Nation is the largest reservation in the US, spanning AZ/NM/UT. ICWA applies to all child welfare cases involving AI/AN children.",
